question:
Give the player id of the player who was at the non-striker end for the most number of balls in the match 501219.

Hint: most number of balls refers to max(Ball_Id); match 501219 refers to Match_Id = 501219;
player id also refers to non_striker or ball_id

llm_calls.text:
{
"response_type": "query",
"sql": "SELECT (SELECT AVG(cnt) FROM (SELECT Match_Id, COUNT(Player_Out) AS cnt FROM Wicket_Taken WHERE Kind_Out = 4 GROUP BY Match_Id)) - (SELECT AVG(cnt) FROM (SELECT Match_Id, COUNT(Player_Out) AS cnt FROM Wicket_Taken WHERE Kind_Out = 3 GROUP BY Match_Id)) AS difference;",
"message": null}
